    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8084" root="حشد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَشِدٌ</span></b>  One <i>who does not leave</i> [<i>unemployed</i>] <i>any
endeavour or aid or property that he possesses;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحْتَشِدٌ</span></b> ; (L, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاشِدٌ</span></b> , pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُشُدٌ</span>.
(L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَادٍ حشِدٌ</span> <i>A valley similar to land such as
is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَشَادٌ</span>: (K:) <i>a valley which a small
and an inconsiderable quantity of water causes to
flow.</i> (TA.)

